  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the function <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math>, then (where,&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>⋅</mo></mrow></mfenced></math> represents the greatest integer part of <math><mi>x</mi></math>)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
